WEBVTT

1
00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:57.620
Have you seen your father?

2
00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:02.060
Your little cousins

3
00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:02.060
have lost their mother.

4
00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:04.920
They could use a kind word.

5
00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.940
I have an equal claim to sympathy.

6
00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.770
- Jace.

7
00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.770
- We should be at Harrenhal.

8
00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:10.810
mourning Lord Lyonel and Ser Harwin.

9
00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:14.130
It would not be appropriate.

10
00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:18.440
The Velaryons are our kin

11
00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:18.440
and the Strongs are not.

12
00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:20.980
Look at me.

13
00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:22.740
Do you understand?

14
00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:53.440
Hand turns loom.

15
00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:55.450
spool of green. spool of black.

16
00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:57.650
dragons of flesh

17
00:05:57.720 --> 00:05:59.550
weaving dragons of thread.

18
00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:03.820
Hand turns loom. spool of green...

19
00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:07.190
- We have nothing in common.

20
00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:07.190
- She's our sister.

21
00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:09.860
- You marry her. then.

22
00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:09.860
- I would perform my duty.

23
00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:12.630
- if mother had only betrothed us.

24
00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:12.630
- If only.

25
00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:14.290
It would strengthen the family.

26
00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:16.130
Keep our Valyrian blood pure.

27
00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:18.870
- She's an idiot.

28
00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:18.870
- She's your future queen.

29
00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:23.410
We actually do have

30
00:06:24.310 --> 00:06:25.870
one thing in common.

31
00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:29.580
We both fancy creatures

32
00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:29.580
with very long legs.

33
00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:33.150
Wench!

34
00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:35.690
- Another!

35
00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:35.690
- Aegon.

36
00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:39.730
...dragon's flesh.

37
00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:39.730
weaving dragons of thread.

38
00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:50.710
Lyonel Strong's son's

39
00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:50.710
been staring at you

40
00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:52.170
since the moment we arrived. Your Grace.

41
00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:57.540
Unabashedly.

42
00:06:59.510 --> 00:07:01.570
It is only a look of pride. Ser Criston.

43
00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:04.580
Larys is the new Lord of Harrenhal.

44
00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:42.150
Both my seat and High Tide

45
00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:44.160
will be yours one day. Lucerys.

46
00:07:45.390 --> 00:07:47.330
Your brother will be king. of course.

47
00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:51.160
He'll sit on endless

48
00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:51.160
councils and ceremonies.

49
00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:53.330
but Lord of the Tides rules the sea.

50
00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:56.130
Sorry.

51
00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:57.400
I don't want it.

52
00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:02.680
It's your birthright. lad.

53
00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:10.750
If I'm the Lord of Driftmark.

54
00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:10.750
it means everyone's dead.

55
00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:20.830
- I'm very sorry. my princess.

56
00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:20.830
- Thank you. Thank you.

57
00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:45.640
Grandma...

58
00:08:50.390 --> 00:08:52.330
I don't want Mother to be gone.

59
00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:08.190
Retrieve your patron.

60
00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:12.360
Brother.

61
00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:56.450
Your girls are the very

62
00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:56.450
image of their mother.

63
00:10:57.950 --> 00:10:59.980
A comfort and an anguish.

64
00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:01.450
as I well remember.

65
00:11:02.990 --> 00:11:04.190
The gods can be cruel.

66
00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:09.320
It seems they've been

67
00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:09.320
especially cruel to you.

68
00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:12.590
Yes.

69
00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:28.950
You should return with us

70
00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:28.950
to King's Landing.

71
00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:31.440
It's time that you came home.

72
00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:32.950
Pentos is my home...

73
00:11:34.490 --> 00:11:36.620
- and that of my children.

74
00:11:34.490 --> 00:11:36.620
- Daemon...

75
00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:39.720
I know we've had our differences.

76
00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:42.290
but let them pass with the years.

77
00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:46.030
There's a place for you in my court

78
00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:47.660
if that's something you should need.

79
00:11:47.740 --> 00:11:50.360
I need nothing.

80
00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:01.040
Brother.

81
00:12:06.150 --> 00:12:08.090
I'm sorry for your loss. my prince.

82
00:12:09.220 --> 00:12:12.750
No matter how fat the leech grows.

83
00:12:09.220 --> 00:12:12.750
it always wants for another meal.

84
00:12:24.040 --> 00:12:25.170
Go to bed.

85
00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:27.000
- But. Mother--

86
00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:27.000
- Go to bed.

87
00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:39.680
I'm going to bed. Aemma.

88
00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:43.950
Shall I see after Queen Alicent.

89
00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:43.950
Your Grace?

90
00:12:48.130 --> 00:12:49.600
No. Ser Harrold.

91
00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:51.430
You have the night's watch. Ser Criston.

92
00:12:53.900 --> 00:12:55.100
Lord Commander.

93
00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:29.840
Brother?

94
00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:37.000
Get to bed.

95
00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:40.410
She wanted to come home

96
00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:42.830
and he denied her.

97
00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:46.240
Daemon did

98
00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:46.240
what he thought best.

99
00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:51.380
Daemon only ever does

100
00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:51.380
what is best for Daemon.

101
00:14:52.920 --> 00:14:54.720
Laena needed our maesters.

102
00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:02.920
The surgeons in Pentos

103
00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:02.920
are as well-trained

104
00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:04.360
as our maesters.

105
00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:12.940
You are looking to place blame

106
00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:12.940
for an act of the gods.

107
00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:17.200
Mayhaps the gods have scorned us...

108
00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:21.780
for our insatiable pride.

109
00:15:27.890 --> 00:15:29.690
The crown was yours

110
00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:34.130
until those fools at the Great Council

111
00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:34.130
plucked it from your head.

112
00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:40.570
Is it such a terrible thing

113
00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:40.570
for your husband to wish to win it back?

114
00:15:40.640 --> 00:15:43.370
Tonight of all nights.

115
00:15:40.640 --> 00:15:43.370
let us lay aside this falsehood.

116
00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:49.280
It is not justice for

117
00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:49.280
your wife that drives you.

118
00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:51.040
It is your own ambition.

119
00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:53.540
'Tis desire for the throne.

120
00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:56.310
if not for yourself.

121
00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:56.310
then for the scions of your house.

122
00:15:57.150 --> 00:15:59.780
I gave up the idea of wearing a crown

123
00:15:57.150 --> 00:15:59.780
a generation ago.

124
00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:02.880
It is you. lord husband.

125
00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:02.880
who refuses to abandon this pursuit.

126
00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:04.950
even now. at the cost of our children.

127
00:16:21.010 --> 00:16:22.840
What is this brief mortal life...

128
00:16:24.610 --> 00:16:26.440
if not the pursuit of legacy?

129
00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:29.350
Legacy may be why you

130
00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:29.350
live your life. Corlys.

131
00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:43.700
I want Driftmark to pass through

132
00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:43.700
Laena's line to Baela.

133
00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:47.860
To true Velaryon blood.

134
00:16:49.970 --> 00:16:51.670
Declare it now.

135
00:16:49.970 --> 00:16:51.670
while all are gathered here.

136
00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:54.000
and we will say that is how

137
00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:54.000
we will honor Laena's memory.

138
00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:55.700
And disinherit our son?

139
00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:57.780
He will be the King Consort.

140
00:16:58.350 --> 00:17:00.710
His son will one day

141
00:16:58.350 --> 00:17:00.710
sit the Iron Throne.

142
00:17:00.820 --> 00:17:03.340
You would have me cast

143
00:17:00.820 --> 00:17:03.340
an even darker shadow

144
00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:05.440
over those little boys

145
00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:05.440
than already exists.

146
00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:06.720
We are alone here. husband.

147
00:17:06.820 --> 00:17:09.620
You can speak the plain truth

148
00:17:06.820 --> 00:17:09.620
as we both know it.

149
00:17:17.130 --> 00:17:19.330
Rhaenyra's children

150
00:17:17.130 --> 00:17:19.330
are not of your blood.

151
00:17:27.170 --> 00:17:28.670
But Laena's are.

152
00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:34.070
They are her legacy.

153
00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:38.820
History does not remember blood.

154
00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:45.580
It remembers names.

155
00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:09.780
Laenor has been restless for years.

156
00:18:09.880 --> 00:18:13.550
but now. he will be useless.

157
00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:15.220
Or worse.

158
00:18:18.260 --> 00:18:21.060
I know better than anyone

159
00:18:18.260 --> 00:18:21.060
that our marriage is a farce.

160
00:18:22.360 --> 00:18:25.730
But I at least make the effort

161
00:18:22.360 --> 00:18:25.730
to maintain appearances.

162
00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:28.630
You have more to lose.

163
00:18:30.240 --> 00:18:33.040
Yes. well. that has been

164
00:18:30.240 --> 00:18:33.040
my lot since my father named me heir.

165
00:18:36.480 --> 00:18:37.600
We did try...

166
00:18:39.750 --> 00:18:41.240
to conceive a child.

167
00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:45.050
We performed our duty as best we could.

168
00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:49.390
But to no avail.

169
00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:58.100
There was no joy in it.

170
00:19:02.770 --> 00:19:04.070
I found that elsewhere.

171
00:19:07.780 --> 00:19:10.140
- It felt good to be desired.

172
00:19:07.780 --> 00:19:10.140
- Mmm.

173
00:19:12.850 --> 00:19:15.180
I understand Ser Harwin was quite...

174
00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:18.810
devoted to you.

175
00:19:21.620 --> 00:19:22.750
Yes. he was.

176
00:19:24.960 --> 00:19:26.260
And I trusted him.

177
00:19:31.800 --> 00:19:34.630
Should've forbidden Ser Harwin

178
00:19:31.800 --> 00:19:34.630
from returning to the Riverlands.

179
00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:38.700
Harren's curse

180
00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:38.700
is said to be as strong now

181
00:19:38.810 --> 00:19:39.930
as it was after the Conquest.

182
00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:40.940
That's a ghost story.

183
00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:44.170
one Ser Otto and the Queen

184
00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:44.170
would gladly exploit.

185
00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:48.320
I do not believe Alicent

186
00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:48.320
capable of cold murder.

187
00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:54.810
Each of us is capable of depravity.

188
00:19:56.890 --> 00:19:58.450
And more than you would believe.

189
00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:03.660
I believe it of you.

190
00:20:06.570 --> 00:20:08.200
If you're accusing me of some depravity.

191
00:20:08.300 --> 00:20:09.670
you'll need to be more specific.

192
00:20:12.470 --> 00:20:13.670
I've been alone.

193
00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:17.880
- You abandoned me.

194
00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:17.880
I spared you.

195
00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:19.670
- You were a child.

196
00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:19.670
Yes.

197
00:20:20.480 --> 00:20:22.350
Yes. I was a child.

198
00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:24.180
And look at what my life

199
00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:24.180
became without you.

200
00:20:26.720 --> 00:20:28.350
Droll tragedy.

201
00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:30.410
And I wonder what you

202
00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:30.410
think of mine by comparison?

203
00:20:31.390 --> 00:20:32.590
I know little of it.

204
00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:39.860
Did you love her?

205
00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:44.270
We were happy enough.

206
00:20:46.110 --> 00:20:48.540
Well. that in itself

207
00:20:46.110 --> 00:20:48.540
is a great achievement.

208
00:20:54.750 --> 00:20:56.380
- I am sorry.

209
00:20:54.750 --> 00:20:56.380
- Don't be.

210
00:20:58.850 --> 00:21:00.910
I am at least allowed

211
00:20:58.850 --> 00:21:00.910
to mourn my losses.

212
00:21:31.820 --> 00:21:32.880
Rhaenyra.

213
00:21:38.460 --> 00:21:39.790
I'm no longer a child.

214
00:22:00.510 --> 00:22:01.850
I want you.

215
00:25:03.830 --> 00:25:04.800
Fuck.

216
00:26:34.290 --> 00:26:35.450
Dohaeras!

217
00:26:36.920 --> 00:26:40.220
Dohaeras. Vhagar! Lykiri!

218
00:26:41.460 --> 00:26:42.400
Lykiri!

219
00:26:47.800 --> 00:26:48.790
Lykiri.

220
00:27:37.580 --> 00:27:38.570
Soves!

221
00:27:42.190 --> 00:27:45.680
Dohaeras. Vhagar! Soves!

222
00:29:35.440 --> 00:29:37.030
Yeah!

223
00:30:00.560 --> 00:30:02.390
Jace. Jace.

224
00:30:02.460 --> 00:30:04.490
Jace. wake up. Wake up.

225
00:30:06.830 --> 00:30:09.890
- Someone stole Vhagar.

226
00:30:06.830 --> 00:30:09.890
- What?

227
00:30:29.760 --> 00:30:30.750
Who is it?

228
00:30:55.380 --> 00:30:57.480
Jace. what are we doing?

229
00:30:57.550 --> 00:30:59.520
- It's him.

230
00:30:57.550 --> 00:30:59.520
- It's me.

231
00:30:59.620 --> 00:31:02.450
- Vhagar is my mother's dragon.

232
00:30:59.620 --> 00:31:02.450
Your mother's dead.

233
00:31:03.120 --> 00:31:05.390
- And Vhagar has a new rider now.

234
00:31:03.120 --> 00:31:05.390
- She was mine to claim.

235
00:31:05.490 --> 00:31:07.120
Then you should've claimed her!

236
00:31:07.190 --> 00:31:09.220
Maybe your cousins

237
00:31:07.190 --> 00:31:09.220
can find you a pig to ride.

238
00:31:09.830 --> 00:31:11.300
It would suit you.

239
00:31:16.840 --> 00:31:18.900
Come at me again

240
00:31:16.840 --> 00:31:18.900
and I'll feed you to my dragon!

241
00:31:50.440 --> 00:31:54.200
You will die screaming in flames

242
00:31:50.440 --> 00:31:54.200
