243
00:31:54.270 --> 00:31:55.440
Bastards.

244
00:31:55.540 --> 00:31:57.240
My father's still alive.

245
00:31:58.110 --> 00:32:01.100
He doesn't know. does he. Lord Strong?

246
00:32:03.180 --> 00:32:04.050
Jace!

247
00:32:24.440 --> 00:32:25.770
Cease this at once!

248
00:32:27.270 --> 00:32:28.240
Get away!

249
00:32:31.080 --> 00:32:33.550
My prince. my prince. Let me see.

250
00:32:37.720 --> 00:32:38.980
Gods be good.

251
00:32:40.790 --> 00:32:42.980
How could you allow

252
00:32:40.790 --> 00:32:42.980
