253
00:32:45.930 --> 00:32:47.390
I will have answers.

254
00:32:47.460 --> 00:32:49.730
The princes were supposed

255
00:32:47.460 --> 00:32:49.730
to be abed. my king.

256
00:32:50.800 --> 00:32:51.820
Who had the watch?

257
00:32:52.900 --> 00:32:55.490
Young Prince was attacked by

258
00:32:52.900 --> 00:32:55.490
his own cousins. Your Grace.

259
00:32:55.600 --> 00:32:59.940
You swore oaths to protect

260
00:32:55.600 --> 00:32:59.940
and defend my blood!

261
00:33:00.010 --> 00:33:01.340
I'm very sorry. Your Grace.

262
00:33:01.440 --> 00:33:03.670
The Kingsguard has never had

263
00:33:01.440 --> 00:33:03.670
