266
00:33:05.810 --> 00:33:08.080
It will heal. will it not. maester?

267
00:33:10.280 --> 00:33:11.580
The flesh will heal.

268
00:33:14.650 --> 00:33:16.250
But the eye is lost. Your Grace.

269
00:33:19.260 --> 00:33:20.630
Where were you?

270
00:33:19.260 --> 00:33:20.630
Me?

271
00:33:21.500 --> 00:33:23.360
- Ow! What was that for?

272
00:33:21.500 --> 00:33:23.360
- That was nothing

273
00:33:23.460 --> 00:33:25.190
compared to the abuse

274
00:33:23.460 --> 00:33:25.190
your brother suffered

275
00:33:25.300 --> 00:33:27.200
while you were drowning

276
00:33:25.300 --> 00:33:27.200
in your cups. you fool.

277
00:33:27.300 --> 00:33:29.430
What is the meaning of this?

278
00:33:29.500 --> 00:33:31.970
Baela. Rhaena!

279
00:33:29.500 --> 00:33:31.970
What happened?

280
00:33:32.040 --> 00:33:33.340
What happened?

281
00:33:37.940 --> 00:33:38.970
Jace?

282
00:33:40.150 --> 00:33:41.170
Luke!

283
00:33:43.150 --> 00:33:45.310
- Show me. Show me.

284
00:33:45.390 --> 00:33:47.120
- Who did this?

285
00:33:45.390 --> 00:33:47.120
- They attacked me!

286
00:33:47.190 --> 00:33:49.450
- He attacked Baela!

287
00:33:47.190 --> 00:33:49.450
- He broke Luke's nose!

288
00:33:54.690 --> 00:33:56.030
He stole my mother's dragon!

289
00:33:57.130 --> 00:33:58.830
- Enough.

290
00:33:57.130 --> 00:33:58.830
He was gonna kill Jace!

291
00:33:58.900 --> 00:34:00.230
- I didn't do anything!

292
00:33:58.900 --> 00:34:00.230
- Enough--

293
00:34:00.330 --> 00:34:01.530
It should be my son telling the tale!

294
00:34:01.640 --> 00:34:03.130
- He called us--

295
00:34:01.640 --> 00:34:03.130
- Silence!

296
00:34:07.140 --> 00:34:08.840
He called us bastards.

297
00:34:15.750 --> 00:34:17.050
Aemond...

298
00:34:17.680 --> 00:34:19.590
I will have the truth of what happened.

299
00:34:21.690 --> 00:34:23.710
- Now.

300
00:34:21.690 --> 00:34:23.710
- What else is there to hear?

301
00:34:23.820 --> 00:34:25.920
Your son has been maimed.

302
00:34:23.820 --> 00:34:25.920
Her son is responsible.

303
00:34:26.030 --> 00:34:28.050
- It was a regrettable accident.

304
00:34:26.030 --> 00:34:28.050
Accident?

305
00:34:28.160 --> 00:34:30.390
The Prince Lucerys brought

306
00:34:28.160 --> 00:34:30.390
a blade to the ambush.

307
00:34:30.500 --> 00:34:31.830
He meant to kill my son.

308
00:34:31.900 --> 00:34:34.660
It was my sons who were attacked

309
00:34:34.730 --> 00:34:36.430
and forced to defend themselves.

310
00:34:37.440 --> 00:34:40.170
Vile insults were levied against them.

311
00:34:40.240 --> 00:34:41.330
What insults?

312
00:34:45.610 --> 00:34:48.840
The legitimacy of my sons' birth

313
00:34:45.610 --> 00:34:48.840
was put loudly to question.

314
00:34:48.920 --> 00:34:51.110
- What?

315
00:34:48.920 --> 00:34:51.110
- He called us bastards.

316
00:34:56.090 --> 00:35:00.960
My sons are in line

317
00:34:56.090 --> 00:35:00.960
to inherit the Iron Throne. Your Grace.

318
00:35:01.060 --> 00:35:02.550
This is the highest of treasons.

319
00:35:04.760 --> 00:35:06.860
Prince Aemond must be sharply questioned

320
00:35:06.930 --> 00:35:09.270
so we might learn where

321
00:35:06.930 --> 00:35:09.270
he heard such slanders.

322
00:35:11.240 --> 00:35:12.300
Over an insult?

323
00:35:13.770 --> 00:35:16.110
My son has lost an eye.

324
00:35:18.580 --> 00:35:21.610
You tell me. boy.

325
00:35:18.580 --> 00:35:21.610
Where did you hear this lie?

326
00:35:21.720 --> 00:35:23.270
The insult

327
00:35:21.720 --> 00:35:23.270
was training yard bluster.

328
00:35:23.380 --> 00:35:24.980
- The lot of boys. It was nothing.

329
00:35:23.380 --> 00:35:24.980
- Aemond...

330
00:35:25.820 --> 00:35:26.980
I asked you a question.

331
00:35:30.560 --> 00:35:33.580
Where is Ser Laenor. I wonder?

332
00:35:30.560 --> 00:35:33.580
The boys' father?

333
00:35:33.660 --> 00:35:35.600
Perhaps he might have

334
00:35:33.660 --> 00:35:35.600
something to say in the matter.

335
00:35:35.660 --> 00:35:36.790
Yes. Where is Ser Laenor?

336
00:35:38.160 --> 00:35:41.600
I do not know. Your Grace.

337
00:35:38.160 --> 00:35:41.600
I... could not find sleep.

338
00:35:41.670 --> 00:35:43.140
I had gone out to walk.

339
00:35:43.900 --> 00:35:46.170
Entertaining his young squires.

340
00:35:43.900 --> 00:35:46.170
I would venture.

341
00:35:50.180 --> 00:35:51.340
Aemond...

342
00:35:52.850 --> 00:35:54.010
look at me.

343
00:35:56.420 --> 00:35:57.910
Your king demands an answer.

344
00:35:58.520 --> 00:36:00.250
Who spoke these lies to you?

345
00:36:18.300 --> 00:36:19.500
It was Aegon.

346
00:36:22.210 --> 00:36:23.270
Me?

347
00:36:25.880 --> 00:36:28.210
And you. boy?

348
00:36:31.050 --> 00:36:33.040
Where did you hear such calumnies?

349
00:36:34.450 --> 00:36:37.860
Aegon! Tell me the truth of it!

350
00:36:39.790 --> 00:36:41.790
We know. Father.

351
00:36:44.060 --> 00:36:46.300
Everyone knows.

352
00:36:47.400 --> 00:36:48.730
Just look at them.

353
00:37:06.250 --> 00:37:08.720
This interminable infighting must cease!

354
00:37:09.490 --> 00:37:10.680
All of you!

355
00:37:13.530 --> 00:37:14.860
We are family!

356
00:37:20.030 --> 00:37:22.870
Now make your apologies

357
00:37:20.030 --> 00:37:22.870
and show good will to one another.

358
00:37:24.100 --> 00:37:27.870
Your father. your grandsire.

359
00:37:24.100 --> 00:37:27.870
your king demands it!

360
00:37:43.290 --> 00:37:44.450
That is insufficient.

361
00:37:47.760 --> 00:37:50.130
Aemond has been damaged.

362
00:37:47.760 --> 00:37:50.130
permanently. my king.

363
00:37:50.230 --> 00:37:51.630
"Good will" cannot make him whole.

364
00:37:51.730 --> 00:37:55.430
I know. Alicent.

365
00:37:51.730 --> 00:37:55.430
but I cannot restore his eye.

366
00:37:55.540 --> 00:37:57.130
No. because it's been taken.

367
00:37:57.240 --> 00:38:00.300
- What would you have me do?

368
00:37:57.240 --> 00:38:00.300
- There is a debt to be paid.

369
00:38:04.210 --> 00:38:05.770
I shall have one of her

370
00:38:04.210 --> 00:38:05.770
son's eyes in return.

371
00:38:10.420 --> 00:38:12.980
- My dear wife.

372
00:38:10.420 --> 00:38:12.980
- He is your son. Viserys.

373
00:38:13.150 --> 00:38:13.980
Your blood.

374
00:38:14.720 --> 00:38:19.060
Do not... allow your temper

375
00:38:14.720 --> 00:38:19.060
to guide your judgment.

376
00:38:25.170 --> 00:38:27.260
If the King will not

377
00:38:25.170 --> 00:38:27.260
seek justice. the Queen will.

378
00:38:28.300 --> 00:38:29.290
Ser Criston...

379
00:38:30.670 --> 00:38:32.660
bring me the eye of Lucerys Velaryon.

380
00:38:33.510 --> 00:38:35.000
- Mother!

381
00:38:33.510 --> 00:38:35.000
Alicent.

382
00:38:35.110 --> 00:38:37.740
He can choose which eye to keep.

383
00:38:35.110 --> 00:38:37.740
a privilege he did not grant my son.

384
00:38:37.810 --> 00:38:39.250
You will do no such thing.

385
00:38:39.310 --> 00:38:41.410
- Stay your hand.

386
00:38:39.310 --> 00:38:41.410
- No. you are sworn to me!

387
00:38:46.520 --> 00:38:48.010
As your protector. my queen.

388
00:38:51.520 --> 00:38:55.590
Alicent. this matter... is finished.

389
00:38:56.630 --> 00:38:57.760
Do you understand?

390
00:39:09.510 --> 00:39:10.530
And let it be known.

391
00:39:11.440 --> 00:39:13.280
anyone whose tongue dares

392
00:39:11.440 --> 00:39:13.280
to question the birth

393
00:39:13.350 --> 00:39:14.680
of Princess Rhaenyra's sons

394
00:39:15.550 --> 00:39:16.980
should have it removed.

395
00:39:20.620 --> 00:39:21.710
Thank you. Father.

396
00:39:32.970 --> 00:39:34.870
- Your Grace. Stay with the King!

397
00:39:32.970 --> 00:39:34.870
- Alicent!

398
00:39:34.970 --> 00:39:36.460
Hold your approach!

399
00:39:36.540 --> 00:39:38.300
Do not. Ser Criston!

400
00:39:36.540 --> 00:39:38.300
Alicent!

401
00:39:38.400 --> 00:39:40.170
- Do not. Ser Criston!

402
00:39:40.240 --> 00:39:41.070
Alicent!

403
00:39:42.010 --> 00:39:42.980
No!

404
00:39:44.510 --> 00:39:45.710
Stay your hand. Cole!

405
00:39:47.850 --> 00:39:50.180
- You've gone too far.

406
00:39:47.850 --> 00:39:50.180
- I?

407
00:39:50.850 --> 00:39:52.910
What have I done but

408
00:39:50.850 --> 00:39:52.910
what was expected of me?

409
00:39:54.090 --> 00:39:57.580
Forever upholding the kingdom.

410
00:39:54.090 --> 00:39:57.580
the family. the law.

411
00:39:59.360 --> 00:40:00.990
While you flout it all

412
00:39:59.360 --> 00:40:00.990
to do as you please.

413
00:40:01.060 --> 00:40:02.220
Alicent. let her go!

414
00:40:02.330 --> 00:40:04.560
Where is duty? Where is sacrifice?

415
00:40:04.660 --> 00:40:06.930
It's trampled under

416
00:40:04.660 --> 00:40:06.930
your pretty foot again.

417
00:40:07.030 --> 00:40:08.700
Release the blade. Alicent.

418
00:40:09.370 --> 00:40:11.030
And now you take my son's eye.

419
00:40:11.100 --> 00:40:12.900
and to even that. you feel entitled.

420
00:40:13.010 --> 00:40:14.440
Exhausting. wasn't it?

421
00:40:15.340 --> 00:40:17.870
Hiding beneath the cloak

422
00:40:15.340 --> 00:40:17.870
of your own righteousness.

423
00:40:19.210 --> 00:40:21.910
But now they see you

424
00:40:19.210 --> 00:40:21.910
as you are.

425
00:40:59.950 --> 00:41:01.150
Do not mourn me. Mother.

426
00:41:02.090 --> 00:41:03.250
It was a fair exchange.

427
00:41:04.990 --> 00:41:06.460
I may have lost an eye...

428
00:41:08.460 --> 00:41:09.620
but I gained a dragon.

429
00:41:18.770 --> 00:41:20.400
This proceeding is at an end.

430
00:41:58.980 --> 00:41:59.970
The Hand. Your Grace.

431
00:42:17.830 --> 00:42:18.820
Say your piece.

432
00:42:19.700 --> 00:42:21.330
Now. what piece is that?

433
00:42:25.000 --> 00:42:26.560
I've conducted myself in a manner...

434
00:42:27.710 --> 00:42:29.300
unbefitting my station.

435
00:42:31.380 --> 00:42:32.540
Or any other.

436
00:42:36.180 --> 00:42:37.480
I lost composure.

437
00:42:39.750 --> 00:42:40.850
assaulted the Princess.

438
00:42:43.660 --> 00:42:44.920
Already the word is spreading.

439
00:42:45.020 --> 00:42:46.750
the gossip speculating

440
00:42:45.020 --> 00:42:46.750
that I've gone mad.

441
00:42:48.900 --> 00:42:49.890
All true.

442
00:42:50.560 --> 00:42:51.720
I disgraced myself.

443
00:42:54.330 --> 00:42:56.930
And ensured my husband's favor

444
00:42:54.330 --> 00:42:56.930
will forever rest on her.

445
00:42:59.610 --> 00:43:00.870
And yet...

446
00:43:02.540 --> 00:43:05.340
I've never seen that side of you.

447
00:43:02.540 --> 00:43:05.340
my daughter.

448
00:43:08.380 --> 00:43:09.850
I even doubted its existence.

449
00:43:09.920 --> 00:43:13.080
- It was an ugly thing. I regret it.

450
00:43:09.920 --> 00:43:13.080
- We play an ugly game.

451
00:43:15.560 --> 00:43:16.920
And now. for the first time.

452
00:43:17.020 --> 00:43:19.750
I see that you have

453
00:43:17.020 --> 00:43:19.750
the determination to win it.

454
00:43:24.100 --> 00:43:26.260
- Rhaenyra--

455
00:43:24.100 --> 00:43:26.260
You see her for what she is.

456
00:43:27.430 --> 00:43:29.600
What the King's stubbornness

457
00:43:27.430 --> 00:43:29.600
has wrought.

458
00:43:34.410 --> 00:43:36.470
- What will he say to me?

459
00:43:34.410 --> 00:43:36.470
He'll forgive you.

460
00:43:38.980 --> 00:43:40.110
What else can he do?

461
00:43:41.810 --> 00:43:44.080
Now go to him. be penitent.

462
00:43:44.720 --> 00:43:46.310
plead the injury to your son.

463
00:43:47.450 --> 00:43:48.750
Keep a grip on your passions.

464
00:43:50.290 --> 00:43:53.820
And I promise you. in time.

465
00:43:50.290 --> 00:43:53.820
you and I together will prevail.

466
00:43:57.600 --> 00:43:59.660
What that rogue Aemond has done

467
00:43:59.770 --> 00:44:01.760
in winning Vhagar to our side.

468
00:44:04.240 --> 00:44:05.900
The boy was right.

469
00:44:05.970 --> 00:44:08.570
It's worth a thousand times

470
00:44:05.970 --> 00:44:08.570
the price he paid.

471
00:44:36.340 --> 00:44:39.330
You will scar. but the wound will heal.

472
00:44:40.840 --> 00:44:42.810
Valyrian steel cuts clean.

473
00:44:50.880 --> 00:44:51.870
Gods.

474
00:44:54.050 --> 00:44:55.320
Is everyone all right?

475
00:44:55.960 --> 00:44:57.510
A broken nose is the worst.

476
00:44:57.620 --> 00:44:58.490
Thank you. maester.

477
00:44:59.630 --> 00:45:00.650
Leave us.

478
00:45:04.960 --> 00:45:05.900
You as well.

479
00:45:06.700 --> 00:45:08.570
You've already found

480
00:45:06.700 --> 00:45:08.570
enough trouble today.

481
00:45:09.540 --> 00:45:10.470
Yes. Mother.

482
00:45:18.810 --> 00:45:20.300
I should've been there.

483
00:45:20.380 --> 00:45:21.870
Those should be our house words.

484
00:45:25.380 --> 00:45:27.980
I have fought dreadful enemies.

485
00:45:28.050 --> 00:45:30.250
but I could not defend my dear sister

486
00:45:31.020 --> 00:45:32.650
far from home and in agony.

487
00:45:34.530 --> 00:45:37.050
- I could not defend you.

488
00:45:34.530 --> 00:45:37.050
- Sit down.

489
00:45:48.370 --> 00:45:50.280
Aemond called our sons bastards.

490
00:45:57.380 --> 00:45:59.180
I have failed you. Rhaenyra.

491
00:46:00.050 --> 00:46:00.950
Our marriage...

492
00:46:02.890 --> 00:46:04.190
I tried.

493
00:46:06.390 --> 00:46:07.380
Our boys...

494
00:46:09.430 --> 00:46:10.950
- I do love them.

495
00:46:09.430 --> 00:46:10.950
- I know.

496
00:46:11.060 --> 00:46:12.090
Deeply.

497
00:46:16.370 --> 00:46:17.700
But I have not. mayhaps...

498
00:46:19.910 --> 00:46:20.900
loved them enough.

499
00:46:27.210 --> 00:46:29.080
I had hoped to bear your children.

500
00:46:31.480 --> 00:46:33.040
The few times we lay together.

501
00:46:37.220 --> 00:46:38.620
Things might've been different.

502
00:46:42.730 --> 00:46:45.560
I hate the gods

503
00:46:42.730 --> 00:46:45.560
for making me as they did.

504
00:46:47.000 --> 00:46:48.130
I do not.

505
00:46:49.340 --> 00:46:50.930
You are an honorable man

506
00:46:52.000 --> 00:46:53.100
with a good heart.

507
00:46:55.270 --> 00:46:56.740
It's a rare thing.

508
00:47:02.950 --> 00:47:05.280
We made an arrangement

509
00:47:02.950 --> 00:47:05.280
all those years ago

510
00:47:05.350 --> 00:47:07.120
to do our duty and...

511
00:47:08.920 --> 00:47:10.360
yet explore happiness.

512
00:47:17.960 --> 00:47:20.020
But there are times

513
00:47:20.130 --> 00:47:23.160
I think when these things

514
00:47:20.130 --> 00:47:23.160
cannot mutually exist.

515
00:47:26.470 --> 00:47:29.810
Ser Qarl will return soon

516
00:47:26.470 --> 00:47:29.810
to the fighting in the Stepstones.

517
00:47:31.880 --> 00:47:33.970
But I recommit myself to you.

518
00:47:36.050 --> 00:47:40.210
And to strengthening our house

519
00:47:36.050 --> 00:47:40.210
as we prepare you for your ascension.

520
00:47:40.320 --> 00:47:43.690
I will raise our sons

521
00:47:40.320 --> 00:47:43.690
to be princes of the realm.

522
00:47:43.790 --> 00:47:44.880
- Laenor--

523
00:47:43.790 --> 00:47:44.880
- You deserve better

524
00:47:44.990 --> 00:47:46.050
than what I have been.

525
00:47:49.060 --> 00:47:50.360
You deserve a husband.

526
00:48:11.320 --> 00:48:13.680
I've asked them to have wine ready

527
00:48:11.320 --> 00:48:13.680
for you on the ship.

528
00:48:14.320 --> 00:48:15.550
To help you sleep.

529
00:48:23.930 --> 00:48:24.990
I'm so sorry.

530
00:48:28.700 --> 00:48:29.670
Viserys...

531
00:48:29.740 --> 00:48:31.400
We will speak no more of it.

532
00:49:47.780 --> 00:49:49.340
Fire is such strange power.

533
00:49:54.320 --> 00:49:57.150
Everything that House Targaryen

534
00:49:54.320 --> 00:49:57.150
possesses is owed to it.

535
00:49:59.860 --> 00:50:02.260
Yet it has cost us both what we loved.

536
00:50:04.100 --> 00:50:05.930
Perhaps the Velaryons

537
00:50:04.100 --> 00:50:05.930
knew the truth of it.

538
00:50:06.000 --> 00:50:07.430
The sea is the better ally.

539
00:50:09.170 --> 00:50:10.330
Fire is a prison.

540
00:50:11.370 --> 00:50:13.430
The sea offers an escape.

541
00:50:23.150 --> 00:50:24.640
A perversion of justice.

542
00:50:25.350 --> 00:50:26.440
The young Prince...

543
00:50:27.450 --> 00:50:28.280
defiled.

544
00:50:30.120 --> 00:50:31.390
An outrage.

545
00:50:33.390 --> 00:50:34.360
Indeed.

546
00:50:38.300 --> 00:50:42.290
If it's an eye you want to balance

547
00:50:38.300 --> 00:50:42.290
the scales. I am your servant.

548
00:50:47.810 --> 00:50:49.710
That will not be necessary.

549
00:50:52.550 --> 00:50:54.480
But your devotion

550
00:50:52.550 --> 00:50:54.480
has not gone unnoticed.

551
00:50:56.380 --> 00:50:57.680
These are dangerous times.

552
00:51:03.190 --> 00:51:05.590
The day will doubtless come

553
00:51:03.190 --> 00:51:05.590
when I require such a friend.

554
00:51:07.730 --> 00:51:10.750
With not only skill

555
00:51:07.730 --> 00:51:10.750
but discretion as well.

556
00:51:14.170 --> 00:51:17.030
I shall await your call. my queen.

557
00:51:33.390 --> 00:51:34.680
I need you. Uncle.

558
00:52:37.750 --> 00:52:40.310
We could not marry

559
00:52:37.750 --> 00:52:40.310
unless Laenor were dead.

560
00:52:46.090 --> 00:52:47.080
I know.

561
00:53:01.210 --> 00:53:03.840
I've heard about your exploits

562
00:53:01.210 --> 00:53:03.840
in the Stepstones.

563
00:53:04.840 --> 00:53:05.940
Ser Qarl.

564
00:53:06.850 --> 00:53:09.640
Said to be a knight of remarkable skill.

565
00:53:09.720 --> 00:53:10.810
You flatter me. m'lord.

566
00:53:11.620 --> 00:53:13.140
But alas. common-born.

567
00:53:14.390 --> 00:53:17.950
You're a landless knight

568
00:53:14.390 --> 00:53:17.950
with a lord's taste.

569
00:53:18.220 --> 00:53:19.950
Ser Laenor's been kind to me.

570
00:53:21.390 --> 00:53:22.380
Do you know...

571
00:53:25.460 --> 00:53:27.630
there are places

572
00:53:25.460 --> 00:53:27.630
across the Narrow Sea...

573
00:53:29.130 --> 00:53:31.370
where it doesn't matter

574
00:53:29.130 --> 00:53:31.370
what a man's name is?

575
00:53:33.010 --> 00:53:34.870
Only how much gold he possesses.

576
00:53:39.080 --> 00:53:40.710
What are you asking of me. m'lord?

577
00:53:42.550 --> 00:53:43.570
A quick death.

578
00:53:44.980 --> 00:53:46.180
One with witnesses.

579
00:53:55.430 --> 00:53:57.060
I will not be a tyrant.

580
00:53:58.400 --> 00:53:59.560
And rule through terror.

581
00:54:00.930 --> 00:54:03.030
A tyrant rules only through terror.

582
00:54:09.710 --> 00:54:11.680
If the King isn't feared.

583
00:54:09.710 --> 00:54:11.680
he is powerless.

584
00:54:13.210 --> 00:54:14.410
If you are to be a strong queen.

585
00:54:14.510 --> 00:54:16.240
you must cultivate

586
00:54:14.510 --> 00:54:16.240
love and respect. yes.

587
00:54:16.350 --> 00:54:18.280
but your subjects must fear you.

588
00:54:19.120 --> 00:54:20.250
Who let you in here?

589
00:54:24.390 --> 00:54:26.620
Why are you in my father's hall?

590
00:54:31.700 --> 00:54:33.360
You have always looked down on me.

591
00:54:34.770 --> 00:54:35.890
I do love Laenor.

592
00:54:37.300 --> 00:54:38.900
Then grant him this kindness.

593
00:54:40.270 --> 00:54:41.140
Set him free.

594
00:54:41.240 --> 00:54:42.640
You forget yourself.

595
00:54:45.110 --> 00:54:46.700
My lord. Please!

596
00:54:53.490 --> 00:54:54.610
I'll alert the guards!

597
00:55:04.460 --> 00:55:07.130
This will cost Lord Corlys

598
00:55:04.460 --> 00:55:07.130
and Princess Rhaenys

599
00:55:07.230 --> 00:55:08.790
their only remaining child.

600
00:55:12.240 --> 00:55:14.970
And the realm will whisper

601
00:55:12.240 --> 00:55:14.970
that I was somehow responsible.

602
00:55:19.140 --> 00:55:20.670
No!

603
00:55:20.780 --> 00:55:21.910
Let them whisper.

604
00:55:22.480 --> 00:55:25.250
No!

605
00:55:26.420 --> 00:55:27.850
How did you let this happen?

606
00:55:27.950 --> 00:55:29.290
In my fucking hall?

607
00:55:30.160 --> 00:55:31.180
Tell me!

608
00:55:31.290 --> 00:55:34.090
We will know

609
00:55:31.290 --> 00:55:34.090
the truth of it and our enemies won't.

610
00:55:35.330 --> 00:55:37.850
They will fear what else

611
00:55:35.330 --> 00:55:37.850
we might be capable of.

612
00:56:07.830 --> 00:56:09.230
Hen lantoti anogar.

613
00:56:09.860 --> 00:56:11.800
Va syndroti. Vaedroma.

614
00:56:13.730 --> 00:56:15.670
Mero perzot gihoti.

615
00:56:17.470 --> 00:56:19.340
Eledroma iarza sir.

616
00:56:20.010 --> 00:56:21.700
Izuli ampa perzi.

617
00:56:24.580 --> 00:56:26.410
Prumi lanti seteksi.

618
00:56:27.080 --> 00:56:28.340
Hen jeny mazilarion.

619
00:56:30.520 --> 00:56:31.810
Qelossa ozundesi.

620
00:56:32.750 --> 00:56:34.340
Syndroro ono jedo.

621
00:56:35.850 --> 00:56:37.150
Ry kivia mazvestraksi.
